PredSeg

This repository integrates and modifies the local med-ijepa pretraining and
VisualSeg-ijepa segmentation research implementations.

Parts of the code are derived from I-JEPA:
https://github.com/facebookresearch/ijepa
Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates. All rights reserved.
