The full upstream license is retained in LICENSE.

Modifications include hierarchical feature prediction and context reconstruction,
SIGReg/VISReg and modality-conditioned regularization, frozen-backbone medical
segmentation, predictive token fusion and decoders, unified package structure,
portable data configuration, command-line launchers, and regression tests.

This distribution retains the CC BY-NC 4.0 license. Third-party datasets,
text-model weights, and pretrained checkpoints are not included.
